  (text "(1) Status LED 9.1V Zener diode +\n3V LED (120mA max, 6mA actual)"
    (at 43.18 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 65751feb-1779-4c9d-9ba6-4e7c37bacc90)
  )
  (text "TPS1H200AQDGNRQ1 Config.\n\nFAULT pin: diagnostic tool? just leave floating to a touch point\nDIAG_EN pin: controls load with stuff like overcurrent, thermal protections, etc.?\nCL pin: current limit. Connect right to ground if un-used. Else, use resistor before connection to ground.\n    R_CL = (V_CL * K_CL) / I_out, V_CL = 0.8, K_CL = 2500\n    R_CL = (0.8 * 2500) / 0.25 = 8000 [Ohm]\nDELAY = set to auto-retry mode (connect w/ 100kOhm resistor to VS\nIN = controls output? Set to same as VS since we aren't controlling via microcontroller"
    (at 16.51 114.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 67689525-bdd4-445d-9b6e-69ed4e5d32a5)
  )
